{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は劇場公演でしたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日からしばらくたってしまったけど、今日も楽しかったですっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと踊るの楽しいですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/05/21/7800968/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとレベルあげたいで候。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は選抜総選挙の速報が発表されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/05/21/7800968/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票して下さった皆さんありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか名前を呼ばれるとは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の為にと動いて下さった皆さんがいるというのを感じで本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ったからには開票日まで一生懸命活動して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の数字"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を目標に頑張って行きたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん応援よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は早いのでっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}